WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.880
Buying your first home can feel like a big step.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.760
It often begins before you have even found the right property.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.440
We're here to help you with that journey.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:20.140
An adviser can help you understand what you may be able to borrow, based on your individual circumstances and lender criteria.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:26.540
You can start your journey in your own time using our customer portal, or book a conversation when you're ready.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:33.540
Our customer portal helps your adviser understand your situation earlier — so they can focus on what matters most.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:39.480
When choosing a mortgage, your adviser will help you explore options that may suit your circumstances.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.020
They can also help you prepare for the next steps.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:47.960
When the time is right, your adviser can provide an Agreement in Principle.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.580
Although this is not a mortgage offer.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:55.320
It can help you move forward with more clarity when you are ready to make an offer.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:01.620
From your initial application to completion, your adviser works with your conveyancer and estate agent.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:06.000
And when you finally open the door to your new home, it is your moment.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.520
Your journey.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.100
Made clearer.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.200
Understand what you may be able to borrow.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.300
Explore mortgage options with an adviser.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.820
Get your Agreement in Principle.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.320
Make your offer when you are ready.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.720
Move in — and talk about protecting what matters.
